{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790468104376,"sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","part":{"id":"prt_0e037105f001uZ1flJzTTnNAJg","messageID":"msg_0e0370d5f001NPRjgX5opcX1ci","sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","type":"reasoning","text":"Let me understand the current state. The parent-eval.json has 15 rows (1 identity × 15 seeds), and the current average score is 0.112. Let me look at the per-seed details more carefully.\n\nFrom the eval data I can see:\n- Seed 0: progress 0.117, max_depth 4, Xp:9, killed by watch captain\n- Seed 1: progress 0.117, max_depth 4, Xp:9, killed by watch captain\n- Seed 2: progress 0.051, max_depth 1, Xp:7, starvation\n- Seed 3: progress 0.051, max_depth 1, Xp:7, starvation\n- Seed 4: progress 0.161, max_depth 11, Dlvl:11\n- Seed 5: progress 0.117, max_depth 5, Xp:9, petrified by cockatrice\n- Seed 6: progress 0.051, max_depth 1, Xp:7, ...\n- etc.\n\nThe key observation is that seeds 4 does much better (0.161) with max_depth 11, while many others are stuck at depth 1 with low scores. The bot seems to struggle with getting past early dungeon levels.\n\nLet me look at the bot's code to understand its current strategy.","time":{"start":1790468100191,"end":1790468104364}}}
