check if it's eating. Let me look at the inventory/gather_items and eating logic.\n\nActually, let me look at what the `eat_corpses_from_ground` and `eat_from_inventory` strategies do, and how hunger is managed.\n\nLet me also check the `item.py` for eating logic.","time":{"start":1790468122068,"end":1790468135594}}}
