{"type":"text","timestamp":1790468311564,"sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","part":{"id":"prt_0e03a373f0010M1Wz6zDTxK3cK","messageID":"msg_0e0393099001EqAWUBgHGPtDZ6","sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","type":"text","text":"Now I have a good understanding of the codebase. Let me analyze the per-seed results and identify the key improvement opportunity.\n\n**Key observations from the eval data (val-dwa-law-fem, 15 seeds):**\n- Seeds 2,3: die of **starvation** at max_depth 1, Xp:7 (never get past dlvl 1)\n- Seeds 0,1: reach max_depth 4, Xp:9 but die to **watch captain**\n- Seed 4: reaches max_depth **11**, progress 0.161 (best by far)\n- Seed 5: petrified by **cockatrice** at max_depth 5\n- Most seeds struggle to get past dlvl 1\n\nThe most fundamental issue: the bot gets stuck on dlvl 1 and either starves or dies to early-game monsters before descending. The best seed (4) reaches dlvl 11, proving the bot can go deep when it gets there.\n\nLet me look at the exploration logic more closely to identify where to add stair-descent priority:\n\n","time":{"start":1790468306751,"end":1790468311542}}}
