{"type":"reasoning","timestamp":1790469601431,"sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","part":{"id":"prt_0e04ded57001TRV3IfuT5SkHKA","messageID":"msg_0e04de8d1001z1Du5pV7SpnYeI","sessionID":"ses_f1fc909e3ffenldWD8cipIdpHJ","type":"reasoning","text":"All episodes end in just 1 turn with progress 0 and depth 1. This is because `fight2` is now the first strategy after `current_strategy().repeat()`, and it's probably causing immediate issues. The `fight2` strategy requires visible monsters to generate actions, and if there are no visible monsters at the start, or if the condition check fails, it might cause the episode to end immediately.\n\nLet me check the eval output.","time":{"start":1790469598551,"end":1790469601427}}}
